sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as client
  participant A as /api handler
  participant P as pipeline
  participant S as bar store
  participant X as exchange
  participant R as model registry
  participant E as envelope
  C->>A: GET /api/forecast/chart?symbol&interval
  A->>P: readQuery → policyFor(interval)
  P->>S: barsFor(symbol, interval, n)
  alt store is short
    S-->>P: fewer bars than the policy needs
    P->>X: Klines (KlinesSource port)
    X-->>S: append, then answer
  end
  P->>R: modelPath(method) + bars
  R-->>P: path, sigma, fan
  P->>E: Run(topic, key, producer, operator)
  E-->>A: packet + pipeline record
  A-->>C: ok{payload}
